# Security headers for every page Cloudflare Pages serves (see CLAUDE.md,
# "Publishing"). Only the simple ones: a full Content-Security-Policy was
# left out on purpose, as the risk of breaking part of Slate outweighs the
# benefit for a small private app.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
